（错误）"}]}]}, {"type": "listItem", "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "忽略过去的年龄必须为正的约束"}]}]}]}, {"type": "highlightBlock", "attrs": {"backgroundColor": "#eff6ff", "borderColor": "#3b82f6", "icon": "📊"}, "content": [{"type": "paragraph", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "刷题建议：", "marks": [{"type": "bold"}]}, {"type": "text", "text": "若干年前后问题的关键是\"两人变化同步\"。都减n年或都加n年，不能一个减一个加。"}]}]}]}$$ AS jsonb), NULL, '数量关系-年龄问题-若干年前后的核心知识点和解题方法。', category_node.id, CAST('["数量关系", "年龄问题", "若干年前后"]' AS jsonb), FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, NOW(), 0, 0, CAST('{"content_type": "knowledge_point", "category_code": "kp_age_before_after", "source": "fba_content_engine"}' AS jsonb), 1, NOW()
